title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (right_dissent > 60 and not right_resign) or (center_dissent > 60 and not centrists_resign) or (left_dissent > 60 and not sapd_formed) or (labor_dissent > 60 and not unions_independent) or (neorevisionist_dissent > 60 and neorevisionism))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/InternalDissent.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs

# TODO: party dissent events for every faction, have a good image for this... 

= Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, factions have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies. As the only Catholic party, great care must be taken to appease our socially heterogenous base lest our sidelined members splinter from the party. 

[? if right_dissent > 60 : The <span style="color: #000000;">Catholic Conservatives</span> are upset at our direction. ?]
[? if center_dissent > 60 : The centrists are displeased with the direction of our party. ?]
[? if left_dissent > 60 : The <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span> is upset at our direction. ?]
[? if labor_dissent > 60 : The <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> disagrees with our present course of action. ?]
[? if young_conservatives_dissent > 60 and young_conservatives = 1 : The young conservatives are in disagreement about our political direction. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_right
- @concessions_center
- @concessions_left
- @concessions_labor
- @concessions_neorevisionists
- @do_nothing


@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 8; right_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 8; labor_dissent -= 8; young_conservatives_dissent -= 8; workers_z -= 1; rural_z -= 1; catholics_z -= 1

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

# enforcing party discipline applies to all parties.

# each party has a concessions action and an expulsions action.

@concessions_right
title: Give concessions to the right.
view-if: right_dissent > 45
on-arrival: right_dissent -= 7; left_dissent += 4

We have promised to adopt a more conservative posture. This may alienate the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span> faction of our party.

@concessions_center
title: Give concessions to the centrists.
view-if: center_dissent > 45
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 7; right_dissent += 2; young_conservatives_dissent += 2; left_dissent += 2

We have promised to take more policy suggestions from the centrists. The left and right wings of the party are displeased with our vacillation.

@concessions_left
title: Give concessions to the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">left</span>.
view-if: left_dissent > 30
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 7; right_dissent += 4; center_dissent += 2

We have promised that we will listen to the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span> faction in the party. Of course, this leads to increased dissent from the centrists and the conservatives.

@concessions_labor
title: Give concessions to labor.
view-if: labor_dissent > 30
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 7; center_dissent += 4

The trade unions will be granted more influence in party decision making. This upsets the centrists, who would prefer to centralize political decision making within the party, as well as the right, who are unhappy over preferential treatment for the workers.

@concessions_neorevisionists
title: Give concessions to the Young Conservatives.
view-if: young_conservatives_dissent > 30 and neorevisionism = 1
on-arrival: young_conservaties_dissent -= 7; center_dissent += 5;

Giving the Young Conservatives more influence will cause increased dissent from the centrists.


@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: labor_dissent += 1; left_dissent += 1; center_dissent += 1; right_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.


